---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import MediaFigure from "../components/MediaFigure.astro";
---
<Base
  title="About — Gourmet Gastronomer"
  description="What Gourmet Gastronomer is, and what it is not."
  permalink="/about/"
  crumbs={[{ name: "About", url: "/about/" }]}
>
  <main class="home" id="main">
    <header class="page-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>About Gourmet Gastronomer</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Learn enough about food that the world of food becomes more interesting,
          understandable, navigable, and delicious.
        </p>
      </div>
      <MediaFigure name="wheat" />
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Gourmet Gastronomer is a long-lived food knowledge platform: encyclopedia,
        practical skills library, industry reference, and San Francisco / Bay Area
        food atlas. It is not a conventional food blog, and it is not a marketing
        site.
      </p>
      <p>
        The idea predates Sour Flour. Sour Flour later became a real-world
        expression of the bread portion of this project — learning a craft and
        teaching it in San Francisco. Gourmet Gastronomer remains independent
        encyclopedia work. Lineage is recorded at
        <a href="/sour-flour/">Gourmet Gastronomer and Sour Flour</a>; it is
        not a storefront and it is not in the main navigation.
      </p>
      <p>
        How we choose sources, treat incomplete pages, and handle corrections:
        <a href="/method/">Method</a>,
        <a href="/editorial/">Editorial standards</a>, and
        <a href="/corrections/">Corrections</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
